  "id": "motivational-style",
  "term": "motivational style",
  "definition": "Motivational style refers to how a teacher’s interpersonal behavior shapes students’ motivation, either by supporting or undermining their basic psychological needs. In this source, it includes supportive and thwarting ways of relating to students across autonomy, competence, and relatedness.",
